# Environment Configuration for News Headline Generator

# Optional: Force a specific local fine-tuned model or Hugging Face model ID
# Default candidates if unset:
# - sshleifer/distilbart-xsum-12-3
# - facebook/bart-large-xsum
# - google/pegasus-xsum
